    },
    {
      "text": "aggregator. Solid grey arrows indicate data or request flow (TDI scan-in, TDO scan-out, and pad connections); dashed",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 392.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "arrows indicate return paths, secondary selection, or the gold clock-stop control path.",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 405.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "4.3.1. JTAG Interface Unit",
      "size": 13.0,
      "family": "19e269+NotoSerif",
      "top": 435.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The JTAG Interface Unit (JIU) is the top-level JTAG control module. It contains:",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 464.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u2022 One Primary TAP (PTAP) \u2014 the main chiplet JTAG entry point, connected to the five external JTAG pins (TCK, TDI,",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 490.0,
      "left": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "TDO, TMS, TRST_n).",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 503.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u2022 A configurable set of Secondary TAPs (STAPs) \u2014 for I/O chiplet-to-chiplet JTAG, SMC CPU debug, SEP CPU debug, and",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 523.0,
      "left": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "optional extra TAPs.",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 536.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u2022 An iJTAG network with SIB-based chains for DFT secure, DFT non-secure, DFD, SMC fabric debug (JTAG2AXI), SMC",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 556.0,
      "left": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "OTP (JTAG2AXIL), and SEP OTP (JTAG2AXIL).",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 569.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": "4.3.2. Cross Trigger Network",
      "size": 13.0,
      "family": "19e269+NotoSerif",
      "top": 599.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cross Trigger Network (CTN) routes cross-trigger pulses between on-chip sources and sinks and the external CTP",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 628.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "pads. It consists of:",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 642.0,
      "left": 48.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u2022",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 667.0,
      "left": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross Trigger Ports (CTPs)",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "19e269+NotoSerif",
      "top": 667.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": " \u2014 pad-facing modules, each connecting to four I/O pads (CT_Req_out, CT_Ack_in,",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 667.0,
      "left": 192.0
    },
    {
      "text": "CT_Req_in, CT_Ack_out) and supporting both wire-OR and point-to-point signalling.",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 681.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u2022",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 700.0,
      "left": 58.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Cross Trigger Matrix (CTM)",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "19e269+NotoSerif",
      "top": 700.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": " \u2014 a 26",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 700.0,
      "left": 194.0
    },
    {
      "text": "\u00d7",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "b600a6+NotoSerif",
      "top": 700.0,
      "left": 228.0
    },
    {
      "text": "26 AND-OR crossbar that statically routes trigger pulses under AXI-Lite CSR",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 700.0,
      "left": 233.0
    },
    {
      "text": "control.",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 714.0,
      "left": 66.0
    },
    {
      "text": "14",
      "size": 9.0,
      "family": "92d887+NotoSerif",
      "top": 768.0,
      "left": 49.0
    }
